  id: Aldric-SecondMeet
  lines:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5a514978306f4b2409d70370a8d0ee24, type: 2}
    text: Good that you have Survived the path leading here.
    topics: []
    quest: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActors: []
    rewards: []
    nextLineIndex: 1
    questAcceptNextLineIndex: 0
    questDeclineNextLineIndex: 0
    checkpointIndex: 0
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5a514978306f4b2409d70370a8d0ee24, type: 2}
    text: The enemies count is higher than we have expected.
    topics: []
    quest: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActors: []
    rewards: []
    nextLineIndex: 2
    questAcceptNextLineIndex: 0
    questDeclineNextLineIndex: 0
    checkpointIndex: 0
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5a514978306f4b2409d70370a8d0ee24, type: 2}
    text: You have to be more careful when fighting enemies as they can overwhelm
      you by the count.
    topics: []
    quest: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActors: []
    rewards: []
    nextLineIndex: 3
    questAcceptNextLineIndex: 0
    questDeclineNextLineIndex: 0
    checkpointIndex: 0
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5a514978306f4b2409d70370a8d0ee24, type: 2}
    text: From my side all i can do is give you some supplies
    topics: []
    quest: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActors: []
    rewards:
    - quantity: 5
      itemSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 421dde164514960428efe69cb10cfb5f, type: 2}
    - quantity: 100
      itemSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5659d0b4f9cd3cc4591f4370bda7766f, type: 2}
    - quantity: 7
      itemSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5d42c41d87998dd4c8fc84ecaabec365, type: 2}
    nextLineIndex: 4
    questAcceptNextLineIndex: 0
    questDeclineNextLineIndex: 0
    checkpointIndex: 0
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5a514978306f4b2409d70370a8d0ee24, type: 2}
    text: Fight and conquer the Gold Mine.
    topics: []
    quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fbeae4504d4c8ec469a9bdbdb030233c, type: 2}
    requiredActors: []
    rewards: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    questAcceptNextLineIndex: 5
    questDeclineNextLineIndex: 6
    checkpointIndex: 0
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5a514978306f4b2409d70370a8d0ee24, type: 2}
    text: Is the mine conquered?
    topics: []
    quest: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActors: []
    rewards: []
    nextLineIndex: 7
    questAcceptNextLineIndex: 0
    questDeclineNextLineIndex: 0
    checkpointIndex: 0
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5a514978306f4b2409d70370a8d0ee24, type: 2}
    text: I can leave you but the crown won't. Keep in mind.
    topics: []
    quest: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActors: []
    rewards: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    questAcceptNextLineIndex: 0
    questDeclineNextLineIndex: 0
    checkpointIndex: 0
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5a514978306f4b2409d70370a8d0ee24, type: 2}
    text: Good, The mine will start to produce gold like usual.
    topics: []
    quest: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActors: []
    rewards: []
    nextLineIndex: 8
    questAcceptNextLineIndex: 0
    questDeclineNextLineIndex: 0
    checkpointIndex: 0
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5a514978306f4b2409d70370a8d0ee24, type: 2}
    text: Now, the mine 3 is yet to be reclaimed.
    topics: []
    quest: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActors: []
    rewards: []
    nextLineIndex: 1
    questAcceptNextLineIndex: 0
    questDeclineNextLineIndex: 0
    checkpointIndex: 0
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5a514978306f4b2409d70370a8d0ee24, type: 2}
    text: Travel SouthWest for until reach the sea. From there travel North to reach
      the mine 3.
    topics: []
    quest: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActors: []
    rewards: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    questAcceptNextLineIndex: 0
    questDeclineNextLineIndex: 0
    checkpointIndex: 10
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5a514978306f4b2409d70370a8d0ee24, type: 2}
    text: Mine 2 is safe!
    topics: []
    quest: {fileID: 0}
    requiredActors: []
    rewards: []
    nextLineIndex: -1
    questAcceptNextLineIndex: 0
    questDeclineNextLineIndex: 0
